=====


Important concept

This code does not deploy the model yet. It only prepares/registers the trained model configuration.

The typical next step is:

predictor = model.deploy(
    initial_instance_count=1,
    instance_type="ml.m5.large"
)

Then the workflow becomes:

model.tar.gz + inference.py
            │
            ▼
       SKLearnModel
            │
            ▼
      SageMaker Endpoint
            │
            ▼
       Send Input Data
            │
            ▼
         Prediction

So, in simple words: your previous code trained and saved the model; this code takes that saved model and connects it with inference.py, preparing it for deployment and real-time predictions.

